{"tail":" "}
{"start":"t:foreign","attrs":{"{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"en"}}
{"text":"Let man always fear God in private, acknowledge the truth, speak truth in his heart and rise early in the morning and say:"}
